      "created_at": "2026-01-14T01:39:03.088Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a Desk page where I’ve embedded custom ReactJS. How can I expose it via an iframe to an external site without running into permission issues? Does Frappe support this?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/3/53dfcab4ae3f923f0615a4fc2ae7ca14d7a47591.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/53dfcab4ae3f923f0615a4fc2ae7ca14d7a47591\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-01-13 142524\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53dfcab4ae3f923f0615a4fc2ae7ca14d7a47591_2_690x341.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-13 142524\" data-base62-sha1=\"bXZ6jlYFTcj1g3IF3OeYGPJ20jn\" width=\"690\" height=\"341\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53dfcab4ae3f923f0615a4fc2ae7ca14d7a47591_2_690x341.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53dfcab4ae3f923f0615a4fc2ae7ca14d7a47591_2_1035x511.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53dfcab4ae3f923f0615a4fc2ae7ca14d7a47591_2_1380x682.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"727374\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-01-13 142524</span><span class=\"informations\">1826×903 25 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
