      "created_at": "2026-01-14T12:04:16.501Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/khanhhh\">@Khanhhh</a></p>\n<p>The external site generally does not allow embedding iframe and that is why permission error pop ups.</p>\n<p>In Workspace Custom HTML, iframes work fine and does not block authenticated pages. For example insight dashboard can easily be embedded by using iframe within ERPNext.</p>\n<p>If your goal is to show a report, dashboard, or another ERPNext instance, a better option is to create a Web Page in ERPNext and embed content there.</p>",
